          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/29109965092251-How-to-configure-your-opt-out-keyword-settings#h_01J7K9NVY97661RVY9FY8HTDNE",
          "text": "Before you begin"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/29109965092251-How-to-configure-your-opt-out-keyword-settings#h_01J7HDKF611CKXSD6ETN50EQAX",
          "text": "How each option for opt-out keywords works"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/29109965092251-How-to-configure-your-opt-out-keyword-settings#h_01J7HDKF61MY8ERN2R1VSV7NBE",
          "text": "Change your opt-out keyword settings"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/29109965092251-How-to-configure-your-opt-out-keyword-settings#additional-resources",
          "text": "Additional resources"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/29928896469531",
          "text": "article on how compliance keywords work."
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/26977831996315",
          "text": "Understanding the opt-out options for an SMS message"
